<title>USA: AutoImmune stake increased by partnership.</title>
<headline>AutoImmune stake increased by partnership.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Partners said Tuesday they raised their stake in AutoImmune Inc to 1,305,000 common shares or eight percent from 6.3 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the New York partnership said they bought 231,200 common shares from September 11 to October 7 at prices ranging from $8.80 to $12.25 per share.</p>
